<section class="hero">
<div class="container">
<div class="hero-content">
<span class="hero-eyebrow">Custom Ice Cream Cakes · Order 48 Hours Ahead</span>
<h1>DQ® Cakes Menu 2026</h1>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>Dairy Queen Ice Cream Cake Menu — Complete 2026 Ordering Guide</h2>
    <p>Looking for the official <strong>Dairy Queen ice cream cake menu</strong>? DQ Cakes have anchored family birthdays, sports banquets, graduations, and office parties for decades. Unlike traditional sponge cakes that can dry out, genuine DQ Cakes are constructed from layers of creamy vanilla and chocolate soft serve, sandwiching a decadent layer of rich chocolate fudge and Dairy Queen's proprietary chocolate crunch cookies.</p>
    <p>From affordable 8-inch family rounds to premium Blizzard-infused showstoppers and large party sheet cakes, here is our verified 2026 price guide and step-by-step ordering protocol.</p>

    <h2>2026 DQ Cake Menu With Prices &amp; Sizing</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
      <thead><tr><th>DQ Cake Option</th><th>Starting Price</th><th>Servings</th><th>Description &amp; Construction</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/dq-cake-round-8inch">Classic DQ Cake — 8-inch Round</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$22.99+</td><td>8–10 guests</td><td>Classic vanilla &amp; chocolate soft serve, hot fudge, crunchy chocolate center, whipped icing</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/dq-cake-round-10inch">Classic DQ Cake — 10-inch Round</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$32.99+</td><td>12–16 guests</td><td>Full-sized celebration cake with classic fudge and cookie crunch layers</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/oreo-blizzard-cake">Oreo® Blizzard® Cake (10-inch)</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$38.74+</td><td>12–16 guests</td><td>DQ's #1 best-selling cake: soft serve blended with real Oreo cookie pieces throughout</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/cookie-dough-blizzard-cake">Cookie Dough Blizzard® Cake</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$35.99+</td><td>12–16 guests</td><td>Chocolate chip cookie dough chunks and fudge layered into the soft serve base</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Choco Brownie Extreme Blizzard® Cake</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$35.99+</td><td>12–16 guests</td><td>Chewy brownie bites, cocoa fudge, and choco chunks for ultimate chocolate lovers</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Reese's® PB Cup Blizzard® Cake</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$35.99+</td><td>12–16 guests</td><td>Chopped Reese's peanut butter cups blended with creamy vanilla and chocolate soft serve</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/dq-sheet-cake">DQ Sheet Cake (11" x 14")</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$44.99+</td><td>24–32 guests</td><td>Large rectangular format built for milestone events, school parties, and team celebrations</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>

    <h2>Classic DQ Cake vs. Blizzard Cake: What Sets Them Apart?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Classic DQ Cakes:</strong> Feature solid, velvety vanilla and chocolate soft serve surrounding the signature fudge-and-crunch core. Ideal for traditional celebrations where broad crowd appeal is essential.</li>
      <li><strong>Blizzard Cakes:</strong> Swap standard soft serve for a full Blizzard flavor—incorporating real baked cookie chunks, brownies, or peanut butter cups throughout the cake matrix.</li>
      <li><strong>Same-Day vs. Custom Ordering:</strong> Most DQ locations maintain pre-decorated 8-inch and 10-inch cakes in standard display freezers for immediate same-day grab-and-go pickup. However, custom personalized writing, custom color borders, or edible photo toppers require a <strong>48-hour advance order</strong>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Can you pick up a DQ Cake same-day?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes! Most Dairy Queen locations keep an inventory of freshly decorated 8-inch and 10-inch cakes in popular themes ready in the walk-in display freezer. For custom names, photo toppers, or specialty Blizzard flavors, call or order online at least 48 hours in advance.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Which DQ Cake flavor is most popular?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">The 10-inch Oreo® Blizzard® Cake is Dairy Queen's top-selling celebration cake by a wide margin, delivering beloved Oreo crunch and fudge layers to 12 to 16 guests.</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:32px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);font-size:.9rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);">
      For complete menu pricing across all food and treat categories, visit <a href="/"><strong>The Queen Dairy Menu</strong></a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
